    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "一套支架，三种玩法",
        "en": "Three games on one frame"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/JB5038A/b9f8a2a69c61.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "上方篮球圈用于投篮，下方球门用于射门，两侧目标用于套圈。孩子可以轮流换项目，也可以和伙伴各选一种玩法，不必为每个游戏单独准备一套支架。",
        "en": "The upper hoop is for basketball, the lower goal for football, and the side targets for ring toss. Players can take turns between games using the same frame."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "高132 cm，底部94 × 75 cm",
        "en": "132 cm high, with a 94 × 75 cm base"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/JB5038A/33853eb6d0c9.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "原图标注支架整体高132 cm，底部宽94 cm、深75 cm，下方球门高76 cm。布置时还要给正面投篮、射门和两侧套圈留出活动距离。",
        "en": "The original image labels the frame at 132 cm high, with a base 94 cm wide and 75 cm deep. The lower goal is 76 cm high. Allow extra space in front and at the sides for the three games."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "球、套圈和打气筒数量明确",
        "en": "Counted balls, rings and pump"
